  "title": "Howmet Aerospace Announces New Executive Leadership Member",
  "summary": "PITTSBURGH, April 13, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Howmet Aerospace Inc. (NYSE:HWM) announced today that Jonathan Arena has joined Howmet as Executive Vice President, Chief Legal and Compliance Officer and Secretary. He will also serve on the Howmet Aerospace Executive Leadership Team, the senior leadership team that sets strategic direction for the company. Jon most recently was Vice […]",
